      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be great for users AND creators. As of right now, creators need to define and create presets in unity which is a hassle and time consuming.\nTo be able to make any type of preset on the fly while in game would be a game changer.\nChillout VR does just that!\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZzRhl7sAczA&t=455s\nAll creators would need to do is make the toggle. The user just selects whatever toggles they want and save it",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
